e23ef41568b6e8cb5fe6f209257127e3a6\",\"scope_quotes\":[\"c. The applicant may not continue to use a previous name after a material name change unless the name change documentation specifically permits the applicant to continue using that name (see 8 FAM 403.1-6 regarding “known as” names).\"],\"scope_text\":\"After a material name change, unless the name change documentation specifically permits the applicant to continue using that name.\",\"section_id\":\"fam-names-section-4\",\"start\":1198,\"summary\":\"The applicant may not continue to use a previous name after a material name change unless the name change documentation specifically permits the applicant to continue using that name (see 8 FAM 403.1-6 regarding “known as” names).\",\"target_ids\":[],\"typed_values\":[]}",
