      "dcterms:description": "{\"action\":\"\",\"actor\":\"\",\"alternative_quotes\":[],\"applies_to\":[],\"assertion_ids\":[\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:f3b47c7640499f20430c24051c35fa4c47337355906c3c72ac378703524055fb\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:49d4d708b1468bc2c7e8718044d3bc2f4fb9b9c8ec6d1856bf01c1d530bb8082\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:1fb7c5358bea0cee06b83eb0fa0aaa6d256268532e067b2c34a5f881a671cbad\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:8d566a2928907e4a42233506fe73039d5d779966fe31cc2bc9907ef581c92aea\"],\"choice_quote\":\"\",\"choice_text\":\"\",\"claimants\":[],\"concepts\":[],\"context_quotes\":[],\"effective_periods\":[],\"end\":1670,\"evidence\":[{\"end\":1670,\"field\":\"summary\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aaa23cc4bc9758753066c6a970bc4e4d08f001f9fb228a7ab60b296a5ade86fdc:1433:1670:sha256-7fb835ed90fc315e25a5a9fafb4fd8b0f920d83c8e64fd1e2aa3da14a15e5930\",\"quote\":\"d. The applicant's name is an integral part of her/his identity. Consequently, under 22 CFR 51.23(c), evidence of identity might be required in accordance with Department guidance to establish the name that best identifies the applicant:\",\"start\":1433},{\"end\":1561,\"field\":\"modality\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aaa23cc4bc9758753066c6a970bc4e4d08f001f9fb228a7ab60b296a5ade86fdc:1556:1561:sha256-f23be8eed45492f4b5315117a6ed033788fa26715014cd26c4a059c02ea16cad\",\"quote\":\"might\",\"start\":1556},{\"end\":1670,\"field\":\"scope_text:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aaa23cc4bc9758753066c6a970bc4e4d08f001f9fb228a7ab60b296a5ade86fdc:1433:1670:sha256-7fb835ed90fc315e25a5a9fafb4fd8b0f920d83c8e64fd1e2aa3da14a15e5930\",\"quote\":\"d. The applicant's name is an integral part of her/his identity. Consequently, under 22 CFR 51.23(c), evidence of identity might be required in accordance with Department guidance to establish the name that best identifies the applicant:\",\"start\":1433}],\"id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:revision:e6c841bdc5b83563ac731be2f8d1045541474a1266680a5df85720cf8d1e5332\",\"jurisdiction\":\"\",\"jurisdiction_quote\":\"\",\"kind\":\"statement\",\"logic_text\":\"\",\"meaning_assertion_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:8d566a2928907e4a42233506fe73039d5d779966fe31cc2bc9907ef581c92aea\",\"modality\":\"possible\",\"modality_quote\":\"might\",\"object\":\"\",\"occurrence_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:occurrence:fbd67aa4fe9d9f8348c7d13be18aae2906cf057eafec743fc1762bb09144b23c\",\"origin\":\"aiSuggested\",\"quote\":\"d. The applicant's name is an integral part of her/his identity. Consequently, under 22 CFR 51.23(c), evidence of identity might be required in accordance with Department guidance to establish the name that best identifies the applicant:\",\"references\":[\"22 CFR 51.23(c)\"],\"relation\":\"none\",\"rule_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:rule:a465efbad5336baa05a71a666ca2a7e81cabf452b1b4dc45b3c6e2d99857c587\",\"scope_quotes\":[\"d. The applicant's name is an integral part of her/his identity. Consequently, under 22 CFR 51.23(c), evidence of identity might be required in accordance with Department guidance to establish the name that best identifies the applicant:\"],\"scope_text\":\"Under 22 CFR 51.23(c), in accordance with Department guidance to establish the name that best identifies the applicant.\",\"section_id\":\"fam-names-section-4\",\"start\":1433,\"summary\":\"Because the applicant's name is an integral part of her/his identity, evidence of identity might be required under 22 CFR 51.23(c) in accordance with Department guidance to establish the name that best identifies the applicant.\",\"target_ids\":[],\"typed_values\":[]}",
