        {
          "@type": "oa:TextQuoteSelector",
          "oa:exact": "(3) Applicants who have had a material name change within one year of applying on a form DS-11 do not need to submit ID in the new name. However, if the ID has not yet been changed, they must submit their name change documentation."
        },
